graph TD
    A[Input Tokens] --> B[Input Embeddings plus Positional Encoding]
    B --> C[Encoder Stack - N layers]

    subgraph EncoderLayer [Each Encoder Layer]
        C1[Multi-Head Self-Attention] --> C2[Add and Norm]
        C2 --> C3[Feed-Forward Network]
        C3 --> C4[Add and Norm]
    end

    C --> C1
    C4 --> D[Encoder Output - contextualized representations]

    E[Output Tokens - shifted right] --> F[Output Embeddings plus Positional Encoding]
    F --> G[Decoder Stack - N layers]

    subgraph DecoderLayer [Each Decoder Layer]
        G1[Masked Multi-Head Self-Attention] --> G2[Add and Norm]
        G2 --> G3[Encoder-Decoder Attention]
        G3 --> G4[Add and Norm]
        G4 --> G5[Feed-Forward Network]
        G5 --> G6[Add and Norm]
    end

    G --> G1
    D --> G3
    G6 --> H[Linear Layer plus Softmax]
    H --> I[Output Probabilities over Vocabulary]

    style D fill:#4a90d9,color:#fff
    style I fill:#5cb85c,color:#fff